cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use MDPForge in your research, please cite this software.
type: software
title: 'MDPForge: Finite Markov Decision Processes and Reproducible Solver Benchmarks'
authors:
  - family-names: Forghieri
    given-names: Orso
version: '0.2.1'
url: 'https://github.com/OrsoF/mdpforge'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/OrsoF/mdpforge'
abstract: >-
  MDPForge is a Python toolkit for constructing finite Markov decision
  processes and reproducibly benchmarking dynamic programming solvers,
  with explicit solution-quality checks and experiment records.
keywords:
  - Markov decision processes
  - dynamic programming
  - benchmarking
  - reinforcement learning
  - reproducible research
